<worksheet >
    <title>APP-2 Green's Theorem</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>To earn an M on this outcome, you will need to set up and correctly evaluate 
      the integral.  To earn a P on this outcome, you will need to set up the integral 
      and show progress on evaluating it.</p>
  </introduction>  
  <page>
    <exercise workspace="2.5in"><p>Use Green's Theorem to evaluate <m>\oint_C (y+e^{\sqrt{x}})dx+(2x+\cos(y))dy</m> where <m>C</m> 
      is the boundary of the region enclosed by the parabolas <m>y=x^2</m> and <m>x=y^2</m> with positive orientation.</p></exercise>
  </page>
</worksheet>